#scene("prologue")

@bg("school_evening")

The classroom was unusually quiet.

:: Haruka
You're late again.

@waitClick()

:: Yu
I made it, so it's fine.

@wait(500)

? What do you do?
- "Apologize" -> #apologize
- "Make a joke" -> #joke

#label("apologize")

:: Yu
Sorry. I'll leave earlier next time.

@flag("apologized")
@inc(name="haruka_affection", by=1)
@jump("#after_choice")

#label("joke")

:: Yu
This was a perfectly calculated arrival.

@unflag("apologized")
@dec(name="haruka_affection", by=1)
@jump("#after_choice")

#label("after_choice")

This is a good moment to try Save and Load before continuing.

@page()

@if(flag("apologized"))
:: Haruka
At least you apologized.
@else
:: Haruka
You never change.
@endif

@if(var("haruka_affection") >= 1)
The walk home felt a little lighter.
@else
The walk home stayed awkwardly quiet.
@endif
